        "html": "<div class=\"imtblocks\">\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">diyos</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">God</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">pasik-pu</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">greet-to oneself</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">mariya-se</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">Maria-objective</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">makse</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">we</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">ya=mes</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">and, also, too=you (obj.)</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">wanee-pu</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">be full, be satiated-to oneself</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">curey-min</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">-one characterized by</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">miS-te</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">be good-perfective</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"imtblock\">\n\t\t<div class=\"srcblock\">miisa</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"glossblock\">attend mass</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n",
